        "Provides business consoles to manage listings and track conversational presence."
      ],
      "design_implication": "When designing brand storefronts, product discovery moves from browsing static catalog pages into conversational negotiation inside an external host client. Designers must now specify verified persona boundaries, structured product cards for chat streams, and explicit handoff triggers when automated advice fails. Audit existing purchase flows to isolate structured attributes that conversational agents require to represent inventory accurately.",
