      "title": "eBay blocks autonomous AI agents from scraping and browsing listings",
      "summary": "eBay has blocked autonomous AI agents, including Meta Muse, from browsing listings on its platform. The restriction breaks automated curation workflows that previously gathered daily digests of item prices, shipping terms, and product conditions for buyers.",
