      "design_implication": "When a user relies on an autonomous agent to monitor marketplaces, blocking bots produces empty feeds and broken user expectations without clear cause. Designers of assistant interfaces must build resilient fallback states and bot-detection disclosures rather than assuming open web access remains guaranteed. Add explicit connection status indicators and graceful degradation flows whenever an agent scrapes external platforms on a user's behalf.",
